## telara_jira_get_issue (read)

Get detailed information about a specific issue including all fields, comments, and history.

Pass fields=[attachments] to include any of these extras: attachments, changelog, comments, components, custom_fields, fix_versions, labels, subtasks.

Returns: Single issue object: {id: string, key: "PROJ-123", summary: string, description: ADF object (structured content), status: {name, category}, priority: {name}, assignee: {display_name, email}|null, reporter: {display_name}, labels: [string], components: [{name}], fix_versions: [{name}], created: ISO 8601, updated: ISO 8601, resolution_date: ISO 8601|null, comments: [{author: {display_name}, body: ADF, created: ISO 8601}], history: [{author, created, items: [{field, from_string, to_string}]}].}

